\&        s       Zero disk storage when deleted
\&        S       Write file contents synchronously
\&        t       Disable tail\-merging of partial blocks with other files
\&        u       Allow file to be undeleted
\&        \-R      Recurse
\&        \-v      Set the file\*(Aqs version/generation number
.Ve
