.Vb 5
\&        \-o FILE Output. Default: stdout
\&        \-a HDR  Add header(s). Examples:
\&                "From: user@host.org", "Date: \`date \-R\`"
\&        \-c CT   Content type. Default: application/octet\-stream
\&        \-C CS   Charset. Default: us\-ascii
.Ve
.Sp
Other options are silently ignored
